  "changes": [
    "Engine::forget_historical_source returns typed counts; queue/execution owner boundary requires no outstanding requests including unconsumed handles.",
    "Allocation-free bounded SourceJournalStore.family_contains validates current ancestor revision but follows member identity across older binding revisions; no parallel catalog or tombstone registry.",
    "Program preflights native ownership and empty window replacements, then revokes retained native KV/checkpoint/coverage aliases before deleting the explicit source family.",
    "No active device continuation is released behind ResourceManager; busy/stale refusal does not mutate the source family.",
    "Existing prepared rebuilds fail source validation during normal admission before execution, retain R until actual destruction, and do not fail the whole Engine.",
    "Unrelated sources survive; last-source gauges are cleared when their family is forgotten; new caller-supplied IDs create a new identity without old checkpoint reuse.",
    "Ordinary memory-pressure GC does not call forget; S exhaustion still refuses capture/append rather than silently discarding recovery sources."
